			"notes": "Unifies saltpeter, hot cocoa, and cherry brew with the persistent mixture brewing system. Unfinished drinks retain exact reaction progress when bottled and resume after repouring; finished bottles keep their actual effects while discarding obsolete ingredient history. Includes legacy cauldron/item migration, solid-process safeguards for saltpeter, refreshed manual screenshots, and expanded GameTest coverage."
		},
